{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PhvM4ApDAvD7guStj6H4J3","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→import Head from 'next/head'\n     2→import Link from 'next/link'\n     3→import { useTheme } from '@/hooks/useTheme'\n     4→import { trackThemeToggle, trackLinkClick, trackEmailClick } from '@/lib/analytics'\n     5→import ContactForm from '@/components/ContactForm'\n     6→\n     7→export default function Contact() {\n     8→  const { theme, toggleTheme, mounted } = useTheme()\n     9→\n    10→  const handleThemeToggle = () => {\n    11→    const newTheme = theme === 'dark' ? 'light' : 'dark'\n    12→    toggleTheme()\n    13→    trackThemeToggle(newTheme)\n    14→  }\n    15→\n    16→  if (!mounted) {\n    17→    return null\n    18→  }\n    19→\n    20→  return (\n    21→    <>\n    22→      <Head>\n    23→        <title>Contact • Dupree Ops, LLC</title>\n    24→        <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Contact Dupree Ops, LLC for support, partnerships, or verification.\" />\n    25→        <meta\n    26→          name=\"viewport\"\n    27→          content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=5.0, user-scalable=yes\"\n    28→        />\n    29→\n    30→        {/* SEO Tags */}\n    31→        <meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"contact, support, partnership, business inquiry\" />\n    32→        <meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\" />\n    33→\n    34→        {/* Open Graph */}\n    35→        <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\n    36→        <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Contact • Dupree Ops, LLC\" />\n    37→        <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Contact Dupree Ops, LLC for support, partnerships, or verification.\" />\n    38→        <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://dupreeops.com/contact\" />\n    39→        <meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://dupreeops.com/og-image.jpg\" />\n    40→\n    41→        {/* Twitter Card */}\n    42→        <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n    43→        <meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Contact • Dupree Ops, LLC\" />\n    44→        <meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Contact Dupree Ops, LLC for support, partnerships, or verification.\" />\n    45→\n    46→        {/* Theme & Mobile */}\n    47→        <meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#0f172a\" media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" />\n    48→        <meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#f8fafc\" media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" />\n    49→\n    50→        {/* Canonical */}\n    51→        <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://dupreeops.com/contact\" />\n    52→      </Head>\n    53→\n    54→      <main className=\"min-h-screen bg-slate-50 text-slate-900 dark:bg-slate-950 dark:text-slate-100 transition-colors\">\n    55→        <div className=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-4 sm:py-6 md:py-10 space-y-4 sm:space-y-6\">\n    56→          {/* Header with theme toggle */}\n    57→          <div className=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-3 sm:gap-4\">\n    58→            <Link\n    59→              href=\"/\"\n    60→              onClick={() => trackLinkClick('/', 'Back to home')}\n    61→              className=\"text-sm sm:text-base text-emerald-700 active:text-emerald-600 hover:text-emerald-500 dark:text-emerald-400 dark:active:text-emerald-300 dark:hover:text-emerald-300 transition-colors touch-manipulation\"\n    62→            >\n    63→              [ ← Back to home ]\n    64→            </Link>\n    65→            <button\n    66→              type=\"button\"\n    67→              onClick={handleThemeToggle}\n    68→              className=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-slate-300 bg-white px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-slate-800 shadow-sm active:bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 dark:active:bg-slate-800 dark:hover:bg-slate-800 transition-colors touch-manipulation min-h-[44px]\"\n    69→            >\n    70→              <span className=\"text-xs\">{theme === 'dark' ? '🌙' : '☀️'}</span>\n    71→              <span>{theme === 'dark' ? 'Dark mode' : 'Light mode'}</span>\n    72→            </button>\n    73→          </div>\n    74→\n    75→          {/* Contact form section */}\n    76→          <div className=\"rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white/90 p-4 sm:p-5 md:p-6 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900/70\">\n    77→            <AsciiHeading label=\"GET IN TOUCH\" />\n    78→            <p className=\"mt-4 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 mb-4 sm:mb-6\">\n    79→              Have a project in mind or want to learn more about our services? Fill out the form below and\n    80→              we'll get back to you within 1-2 business days.\n    81→            </p>\n    82→            <ContactForm />\n    83→          </div>\n    84→\n    85→          {/* Additional contact methods */}\n    86→          <div className=\"rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white/90 p-4 sm:p-5 md:p-6 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900/70\">\n    87→            <AsciiHeading label=\"OTHER WAYS TO REACH US\" />\n    88→\n    89→            <div className=\"mt-4 sm:mt-6 space-y-4 sm:space-y-5 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200\">\n    90→              <div>\n    91→                <p className=\"text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400 mb-2 font-semibold\">\n    92→                  &gt;&gt; General & Business Inquiries\n    93→                </p>\n    94→                <p>\n    95→                  <a\n    96→                    href=\"mailto:hello@dupreeops.com\"\n    97→                    onClick={() => trackEmailClick('hello@dupreeops.com')}\n    98→                    className=\"text-emerald-700 hover:text-emerald-500 dark:text-emerald-400 dark:hover:text-emerald-300 transition-colors\"\n    99→                  >\n   100→                    hello@dupreeops.com\n   101→                  </a>\n   102→                </p>\n   103→                <p className=\"mt-1 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n   104→                  For partnerships, new projects, and general business questions.\n   105→                </p>\n   106→              </div>\n   107→\n   108→              <div>\n   109→                <p className=\"text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400 mb-2 font-semibold\">\n   110→                  &gt;&gt; Customer Support\n   111→                </p>\n   112→                <p>\n   113→                  <a\n   114→                    href=\"mailto:support@dupreeops.com\"\n   115→                    onClick={() => trackEmailClick('support@dupreeops.com')}\n   116→                    className=\"text-emerald-700 hover:text-emerald-500 dark:text-emerald-400 dark:hover:text-emerald-300 transition-colors\"\n   117→                  >\n   118→                    support@dupreeops.com\n   119→                  </a>\n   120→                </p>\n   121→                <p className=\"mt-1 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n   122→                  For product support, billing questions, refund requests, and SMS opt-out\n   123→                  assistance. Typical response time: 1–2 business days.\n   124→                </p>\n   125→              </div>\n   126→\n   127→              <div>\n   128→                <p className=\"text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400 mb-2 font-semibold\">\n   129→                  &gt;&gt; Business Information\n   130→                </p>\n   131→                <p>Dupree Ops, LLC</p>\n   132→                <p>3425 Delaney Drive, Melbourne, FL 32934</p>\n   133→                <p className=\"mt-1 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n   134→                  For written correspondence or provider verification, contact us via email with\n   135→                  your reference ID and we will provide documentation confirming ownership of\n   136→                  domains, products, and messaging programs.\n   137→                </p>\n   138→              </div>\n   139→\n   140→              <div>\n   141→                <p className=\"text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400 mb-2 font-semibold\">\n   142→                  &gt;&gt; Social Profiles\n   143→                </p>\n   144→                <div className=\"flex flex-wrap gap-3 mt-1\">\n   145→                  <a\n   146→                    href=\"https://x.com/isaiahdupree33\"\n   147→                    target=\"_blank\"\n   148→                    rel=\"noreferrer\"\n   149→                    onClick={() => trackLinkClick('https://x.com/isaiahdupree33', 'Twitter / X')}\n   150→                    className=\"text-emerald-700 hover:text-emerald-500 dark:text-emerald-400 dark:hover:text-emerald-300 transition-colors\"\n   151→                  >\n   152→                    Twitter / X →\n   153→                  </a>\n   154→                  <a\n   155→                    href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/isaiah-dupree33/\"\n   156→                    target=\"_blank\"\n   157→                    rel=\"noreferrer\"\n   158→                    onClick={() => trackLinkClick('https://www.linkedin.com/in/isaiah-dupree33/', 'LinkedIn')}\n   159→                    className=\"text-emerald-700 hover:text-emerald-500 dark:text-emerald-400 dark:hover:text-emerald-300 transition-colors\"\n   160→                  >\n   161→                    LinkedIn →\n   162→                  </a>\n   163→                  <a\n   164→                    href=\"https://github.com/IsaiahDupree\"\n   165→                    target=\"_blank\"\n   166→                    rel=\"noreferrer\"\n   167→                    onClick={() => trackLinkClick('https://github.com/IsaiahDupree', 'GitHub')}\n   168→                    className=\"text-emerald-700 hover:text-emerald-500 dark:text-emerald-400 dark:hover:text-emerald-300 transition-colors\"\n   169→                  >\n   170→                    GitHub →\n   171→                  </a>\n   172→                </div>\n   173→              </div>\n   174→            </div>\n   175→          </div>\n   176→        </div>\n   177→      </main>\n   178→    </>\n   179→  )\n   180→}\n   181→\n   182→function AsciiHeading({ label }: { label: string }) {\n   183→  const line = '═'.repeat(Math.max(label.length + 4, 28))\n   184→  return (\n   185→    <pre className=\"text-xs md:text-sm leading-snug text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400 whitespace-pre font-mono\">\n   186→{`╔${line}╗\n   187→║ ${label.padEnd(line.length - 2, ' ')}║\n   188→╚${line}╝`}\n   189→    </pre>\n   190→  )\n   191→}\n   192→\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d0b08be0-6b04-4ad1-92cf-1db0e8187dd8","uuid":"1bbb99e3-3763-41c0-9656-ae47a2b594f2","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/isaiahdupree/Documents/Software/DupreeOpsLLC/pages/contact.tsx","content":"import Head from 'next/head'\nimport Link from 'next/link'\nimport { useTheme } from '@/hooks/useTheme'\nimport { trackThemeToggle, trackLinkClick, trackEmailClick } from '@/lib/analytics'\nimport ContactForm from '@/components/ContactForm'\n\nexport default function Contact() {\n  const { theme, toggleTheme, mounted } = useTheme()\n\n  const handleThemeToggle = () => {\n    const newTheme = theme === 'dark' ? 'light' : 'dark'\n    toggleTheme()\n    trackThemeToggle(newTheme)\n  }\n\n  if (!mounted) {\n    return null\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <>\n      <Head>\n        <title>Contact • Dupree Ops, LLC</title>\n        <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Contact Dupree Ops, LLC for support, partnerships, or verification.\" />\n        <meta\n          name=\"viewport\"\n          content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=5.0, user-scalable=yes\"\n        />\n\n        {/* SEO Tags */}\n        <meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"contact, support, partnership, business inquiry\" />\n        <meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\" />\n\n        {/* Open Graph */}\n        <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\n        <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Contact • Dupree Ops, LLC\" />\n        <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Contact Dupree Ops, LLC for support, partnerships, or verification.\" />\n        <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://dupreeops.com/contact\" />\n        <meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://dupreeops.com/og-image.jpg\" />\n\n        {/* Twitter Card */}\n        <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n        <meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Contact • Dupree Ops, LLC\" />\n        <meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Contact Dupree Ops, LLC for support, partnerships, or verification.\" />\n\n        {/* Theme & Mobile */}\n        <meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#0f172a\" media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" />\n        <meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#f8fafc\" media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" />\n\n        {/* Canonical */}\n        <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://dupreeops.com/contact\" />\n      </Head>\n\n      <main className=\"min-h-screen bg-slate-50 text-slate-900 dark:bg-slate-950 dark:text-slate-100 transition-colors\">\n        <div className=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-4 sm:py-6 md:py-10 space-y-4 sm:space-y-6\">\n          {/* Header with theme toggle */}\n          <div className=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-3 sm:gap-4\">\n            <Link\n              href=\"/\"\n              onClick={() => trackLinkClick('/', 'Back to home')}\n              className=\"text-sm sm:text-base text-emerald-700 active:text-emerald-600 hover:text-emerald-500 dark:text-emerald-400 dark:active:text-emerald-300 dark:hover:text-emerald-300 transition-colors touch-manipulation\"\n            >\n              [ ← Back to home ]\n            </Link>\n            <button\n              type=\"button\"\n              onClick={handleThemeToggle}\n              className=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-slate-300 bg-white px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-slate-800 shadow-sm active:bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 dark:active:bg-slate-800 dark:hover:bg-slate-800 transition-colors touch-manipulation min-h-[44px]\"\n            >\n              <span className=\"text-xs\">{theme === 'dark' ? '🌙' : '☀️'}</span>\n              <span>{theme === 'dark' ? 'Dark mode' : 'Light mode'}</span>\n            </button>\n          </div>\n\n          {/* Contact form section */}\n          <div className=\"rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white/90 p-4 sm:p-5 md:p-6 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900/70\">\n            <AsciiHeading label=\"GET IN TOUCH\" />\n            <p className=\"mt-4 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 mb-4 sm:mb-6\">\n              Have a project in mind or want to learn more about our services? Fill out the form below and\n              we'll get back to you within 1-2 business days.\n            </p>\n            <ContactForm />\n          </div>\n\n          {/* Additional contact methods */}\n          <div className=\"rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white/90 p-4 sm:p-5 md:p-6 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900/70\">\n            <AsciiHeading label=\"OTHER WAYS TO REACH US\" />\n\n            <div className=\"mt-4 sm:mt-6 space-y-4 sm:space-y-5 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200\">\n              <div>\n                <p className=\"text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400 mb-2 font-semibold\">\n                  &gt;&gt; General & Business Inquiries\n                </p>\n                <p>\n                  <a\n                    href=\"mailto:hello@dupreeops.com\"\n                    onClick={() => trackEmailClick('hello@dupreeops.com')}\n                    className=\"text-emerald-700 hover:text-emerald-500 dark:text-emerald-400 dark:hover:text-emerald-300 transition-colors\"\n                  >\n                    hello@dupreeops.com\n                  </a>\n                </p>\n                <p className=\"mt-1 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n                  For partnerships, new projects, and general business questions.\n                </p>\n              </div>\n\n              <div>\n                <p className=\"text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400 mb-2 font-semibold\">\n                  &gt;&gt; Customer Support\n                </p>\n                <p>\n                  <a\n                    href=\"mailto:support@dupreeops.com\"\n                    onClick={() => trackEmailClick('support@dupreeops.com')}\n                    className=\"text-emerald-700 hover:text-emerald-500 dark:text-emerald-400 dark:hover:text-emerald-300 transition-colors\"\n                  >\n                    support@dupreeops.com\n                  </a>\n                </p>\n                <p className=\"mt-1 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n                  For product support, billing questions, refund requests, and SMS opt-out\n                  assistance. Typical response time: 1–2 business days.\n                </p>\n              </div>\n\n              <div>\n                <p className=\"text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400 mb-2 font-semibold\">\n                  &gt;&gt; Business Information\n                </p>\n                <p>Dupree Ops, LLC</p>\n                <p>3425 Delaney Drive, Melbourne, FL 32934</p>\n                <p className=\"mt-1 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n                  For written correspondence or provider verification, contact us via email with\n                  your reference ID and we will provide documentation confirming ownership of\n                  domains, products, and messaging programs.\n                </p>\n              </div>\n\n              <div>\n                <p className=\"text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400 mb-2 font-semibold\">\n                  &gt;&gt; Social Profiles\n                </p>\n                <div className=\"flex flex-wrap gap-3 mt-1\">\n                  <a\n                    href=\"https://x.com/isaiahdupree33\"\n                    target=\"_blank\"\n                    rel=\"noreferrer\"\n                    onClick={() => trackLinkClick('https://x.com/isaiahdupree33', 'Twitter / X')}\n                    className=\"text-emerald-700 hover:text-emerald-500 dark:text-emerald-400 dark:hover:text-emerald-300 transition-colors\"\n                  >\n                    Twitter / X →\n                  </a>\n                  <a\n                    href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/isaiah-dupree33/\"\n                    target=\"_blank\"\n                    rel=\"noreferrer\"\n                    onClick={() => trackLinkClick('https://www.linkedin.com/in/isaiah-dupree33/', 'LinkedIn')}\n                    className=\"text-emerald-700 hover:text-emerald-500 dark:text-emerald-400 dark:hover:text-emerald-300 transition-colors\"\n                  >\n                    LinkedIn →\n                  </a>\n                  <a\n                    href=\"https://github.com/IsaiahDupree\"\n                    target=\"_blank\"\n                    rel=\"noreferrer\"\n                    onClick={() => trackLinkClick('https://github.com/IsaiahDupree', 'GitHub')}\n                    className=\"text-emerald-700 hover:text-emerald-500 dark:text-emerald-400 dark:hover:text-emerald-300 transition-colors\"\n                  >\n                    GitHub →\n                  </a>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </main>\n    </>\n  )\n}\n\nfunction AsciiHeading({ label }: { label: string }) {\n  const line = '═'.repeat(Math.max(label.length + 4, 28))\n  return (\n    <pre className=\"text-xs md:text-sm leading-snug text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400 whitespace-pre font-mono\">\n{`╔${line}╗\n║ ${label.padEnd(line.length - 2, ' ')}║\n╚${line}╝`}\n    </pre>\n  )\n}\n","numLines":192,"startLine":1,"totalLines":192}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01XnDih6BY2zuDE1yhtQyT7e","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The pages look good for accessibility. However, I notice a few things that could be improved for WCAG 2.1 AA compliance:\n\n1. The theme toggle button doesn't have an aria-label to describe its purpose\n2. External links (target=\"_blank\") could benefit from aria-label to indicate they open in a new window\n3. The AsciiHeading uses <pre> which is semantic but could benefit from role=\"heading\"\n4. Forms need aria-describedby for error messages\n5. Links and buttons need focus outlines (which are usually present via Tailwind but should be verified)\n\nLet me add these improvements to make the site WCAG 2.1 AA compliant. Let me start with the contact form since it's the most important form on the site.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3601,"cache_read_input_tokens":124844,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3601},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d0b08be0-6b04-4ad1-92cf-1db0e8187dd8","uuid":"e8c610ae-98f6-496f-a616-d78c052492ac"}
